monicon (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Major refactor with SOLID principles
  * New system tray GUI based on PyQt6
  * Global keyboard shortcut support
  * Pluggable monitor definitions via JSON/YAML
  * Configuration management using XDG directories
  * Cross-desktop environment compatibility
  * Improved architecture for future monitor support
  * Added About dialog with version information
  * Fixed misleading "current input" display and silent switch failures

 -- Monicon Contributors <monicon@example.com>  Thu, 30 Jul 2024 00:00:00 +0000

monicon (0.0.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * Command-line interface for MSI monitor control
  * Support for MSI MPG 341CQR QD-OLED X36

 -- Monicon Contributors <monicon@example.com>  Fri, 26 Jul 2024 00:00:00 +0000
